  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>Weighplate is changing the way people track their food.</strong></p><p>Weighplate is the plate you eat from, built with an integrated digital scale that syncs with the app to help users track food weight, calories, and macros with less guesswork.</p><p>Traditional food tracking can feel annoying: separate kitchen scales, extra bowls, extra dishes, and manual logging. Weighplate makes the process simpler by letting users plate their food, track it, and eat like normal.</p><p>Our product is perfect for audiences interested in fitness, calorie tracking, macro tracking, meal prep, weight loss, muscle gain, and healthy eating. Affiliates earn commission on every referred sale through their unique link or discount code.</p><p>Weighplate is highly visual and easy to promote through UGC videos, product demos, kitchen scale comparisons, “how it works” content, and problem-solution ads. If your audience cares about nutrition, consistency, or making food tracking easier, Weighplate is a strong product to promote.</p><p>Current launch offer: <strong>$165 AUD, down from $199 AUD.</strong></p></div></div>",
